breaking news relating to the corona  virus outbreak it has been confirmed  that there are two cases now in England  corona virus has spread to the UK the  flight carrying more than 80 Britons  evacuated is due to land any minute once  they touch down in the UK they'll be  taken immediately to a quarantine center  for a fortnight what happens to those  people making their way back from virus  affected areas symptomatic people have  not been allowed to board but those  without symptoms boarded a chartered  flight to RAF Brize Norton in  Oxfordshire the first plane to arrive  back in the UK had three military medics  on board as well as officials from  public health England and a special  isolation area for people who developed  symptoms after being screened for signs  of infection a script was read by medics  telling people to speak up if they felt  unwell it's unclear what will happen  with any future flights this one was  pretty empty only 83 other Britons in 27  foreign nationals got on board this huge  747 at RAF Brize Norton anyone with  symptoms are taken straight away to  hospital the rest got a coach to arrow  Park Hospital on the Wirral Merseyside -  an NHS isolation unit for the next 14  days the 83 UK citizens will be here in  quarantine  during this quarantine there are severe  restrictions to what patients can do and  where they can go treatment isn't  optional what the experts say goes and  if they develop symptoms they all  receive what we weren't considered to be  supportive care so they'll receive  support to make sure that they're able  to eat and drink properly and if not  they'll receive fluids into the vein and  they'll receive breathing support if  they need it so oxygen or maybe extra  supportive they were to deteriorate but  we don't have any specific treatment or  the virus itself so it's really just  supporting the individuals body until  they can fight off the virus themselves  but it's not all bad quarantine is  designed to be as comfortable  as possible that we fully furnished  rooms laundry facilities food and  self-catering kitchens  families will also be able to stay  together and everyone will have access  to a team of medical staff at the end of  the two weeks if the quarantine time  hasn't been extended freedom will be  restored and life can go back to normal  with a virus continuing to spread there  may be more quarantined to follow
 

